ld be cited)\n- Score (1-6) and confidence (1-5)\n- One-line recommendation\n\nBe rigorous. This is a top venue review.","uuid":"3c4c1632-0f63-4dca-b2d9-3687b8481573","session_id":"faa92117-dd67-43a6-a8f9-8378acfec5f6"}
