{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01BZanAZFkQfzfo5XGkvhSsm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01B41EQ4PRywV1oB8FuMuJD6","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"cost-verify-agent-rl","file":"report.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1451,"cache_read_input_tokens":16941,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1451,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":56,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015GjcCKdVL1X3SHsdHoZxNz","session_id":"faa92117-dd67-43a6-a8f9-8378acfec5f6","uuid":"b0ac8870-6179-4a2c-92cc-c21835efd10d"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B41EQ4PRywV1oB8FuMuJD6","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_1/projects/cost-verify-agent-rl/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-17\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| hsweep_h2_seed1 | Step-independent GRPO with h=2 (minimal context, N=25 windows per episode) will catastrophically collapse due to advantage sign misattribution: early windows retain only γ^24=0.95^24≈29% of terminal return, and all windows in failed episodes receive undifferentiated negative advantage regardless of action quality | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- exp028_prereq_zeroshot_instruct: Qwen3-1.7B-Instruct 零样本 ALFWorld eval，验证\\\\\\\"SFT是毒药\\\\\\\"假设。如果 Instruct ≥15% success（vs SFT checkpoint 6.25%），则确认 SFT 起点有害，exp028a 可跳过 SFT 直接 GRPO。（准备中）\\\\n- exp021_sft_ragen_format: Two-stage SFT with RAGEN-format data (v4). From exp008_sft checkpoint, fine-tune with v4 data (RAGEN Turn/State/Reward structure, fixed system prompt with consistent <answer> tag instruction). LR=5e-6, 2 epochs. Validate via RAGEN val_before_train (not eval_sft_fast). Pass: RAGEN val success >= 10%, action_is_valid >= 85%.（准备中）\\\\n- exp020d_grpo_from_sft: GRPO from exp019b SFT checkpoint (20% success baseline). Sparse reward only (won=10.0), LR=5e-7, kl_loss_coef=0.1, max_grad_norm=1.0, 30 steps. Pass: success ≥ 20%. Symlink fix for response_mask assertion (proven in exp020b). exp020c failed: Hydra key path wrong.（准备中）\\\\n- exp020c_grpo_from_sft: GRPO from exp019b SFT checkpoint (20% success baseline). Sparse reward only (won=10.0), LR=5e-7, kl_loss_coef=0.1, max_grad_norm=1.0, 30 steps. Pass: success ≥ 20%. Fix: symlink + enable_response_mask=false (exp020/020b crashed on response_mask assertion).（准备中）\\\\n- exp019c_expert_sft_v3: Two-stage Expert SFT（重试）: 从 exp008_sft checkpoint 出发，用 v3 数据（保留原始 move actions + admissible actions augmentation）微调。LR=5e-6, 2 epochs, batch=4, grad_accum=4, max_seq=4096。Pass: success ≥ 10%, format_ok ≥ 90%, action_is_valid ≥ 85%。（准备中）\\\\n- exp019b_expert_sft_v2（准备中）\\\\n- exp018_sft_grpo: Expert SFT → Sparse GRPO：从 exp017 SFT checkpoint 开始纯 sparse GRPO 训练。SFT 提升 baseline success rate（≥10%），使 GRPO 有足够非零 reward group 产生有效梯度。LR=5e-7, kl_loss_coef=0.1, max_grad_norm=1.0, won=10.0, 无 bonus/penalty, GRPO 30 步。Pass: success ≥ 20%。（准备中）\\\\n- exp014b: 极低 Dense Reward: valid_action_bonus=0.01（1:1000 比例），测试极弱 bonus 能否防 collapse 又不引发 gaming。如果 bonus 弱到不影响 GRPO reward ranking，模型不会被诱导走捷径。success_reward=10.0, format_penalty=0, 从 exp008 step 5 checkpoint 恢复, GRPO 30 步。（准备中）\\\\n- exp014a: Success-Gated Dense Reward: valid_action_bonus=0.15 只在 group 内至少一条 trajectory success 时才给。消除 reward gaming 的独立最大化路径——没有 success 就没有 bonus，模型必须探索 success。success_reward=10.0, format_penalty=0, 从 exp008 step 5 checkpoint 恢复, GRPO 30 步。（准备中）\\\\n- exp014c: Success-gated valid_action_bonus：bonus 仅在 episode 成功时累加到 reward，消除独立最大化路径。valid_action_bonus=0.15, success_reward=10.0。解决 exp013f reward gaming（unconditional bonus 导致 agent 放弃 success 追求 valid action）。从 step 5 checkpoint 恢复 GRPO 30 步。（准备中）\\\\n- …另有 8 项\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp025c** (failed): —\\\\n- **exp029_episode_level** (success): Episode-level 训练（context_window_mode: full）解决 step_independent h=2 的信用分配缺陷，模型能学到跨步规划策略，val success 不再停滞于 baseline。 ← 基于 exp028c_selfguide_recipe\\\\n  [exp029_episode_level_diagnose_attempt4](/api/workspace-files/projects/cost-verify-agent-rl/artifacts/exp029_episode_level/report/diagnose_attempt4.md) | [tatsu_patch_deploy_plan](/api/workspace-files/projects/cost-verify-agent-rl/artifacts/exp029_episode_level/intermediate/tatsu_patch_deploy_plan.md) | [credit_assignment_analysis](/api/workspace-files/projects/cost-verify-agent-rl/artifacts/exp029_episode_level/chart/credit_assignment_analysis_info.md)\\\\n- **exp026_step_independent_grpo** (negative): Step-independent GRPO（每步独立优化、不建模跨步依赖）能在ALFWorld多步任务中学到有效策略，因为每步的local reward信号足以引导正确行为选择 ← 基于 exp021_ragen_sft_v4\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 4 / 负向 5 / 失败 20 / 共 38\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nbjb1-17606: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- exp_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001b: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_002: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp003: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp007: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp009: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp010: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp011: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp012: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp012b: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp013: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp013b: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp013c: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp013d: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp013e: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp015: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp016: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp019_expert_sft_v2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp020_grpo_from_sft: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp022_grpo_from_sft_v4: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp023_grpo_parallel: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp023c_grpo_serial: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp024_success_gated_grpo: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp025: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp025b: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp025c: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp027_stable_grpo: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp028a_recipe_fix: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp028c_selfguide_recipe: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4728, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015GjcCKdVL1X3SHsdHoZxNz","session_id":"faa92117-dd67-43a6-a8f9-8378acfec5f6","uuid":"9fabce35-a63e-42bc-83df-111c94e4c9ca","timestamp":"2026-05-17T12:55:52.358Z"}
